          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 84793,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saatnya membuat fungsi yang mengambil keputusan. Sebagai langkah pertama, mari kita lihat cara menumpuk pernyataan kondisional di dalam fungsi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "One Indent",
            "id": 84801,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita tahu bahwa fungsi adalah blok kode. Artinya, instruksi yang dibuat bersarang dikelilingi oleh kurung kurawal dan memiliki spasi tambahan di sisi kiri.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayMessage(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"57\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>console.log(message);</code>, dan terakhir <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi adalah blok kode. Instruksi bersarang memiliki kurung kurawal dan spasi tambahan di kiri. Lengkapi agar menampilkan <code>Approved</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayMessage(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;message&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(message)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Denied\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>message</code>, <code>displayMessage</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"Approved\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Braces and spaces",
            "id": 84797,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menambahkan blok kode lain di dalam fungsi. Saat melakukannya, pasangan kurung kurawal tambahan membantu kita mengetahui instruksi mana yang termasuk di bagian mana.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>{</code>, lalu <code>}</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Blok kode dapat ditambahkan dalam fungsi. Kurung kurawal menunjukkan letak instruksi. Lengkapi agar penyewa berusia <code>26</code> disetujui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"isRenting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"26\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>age</code>, diikuti oleh <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>21</code>, <code>{</code>, dan terakhir <code>isRentingAge</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Indenting the entire block",
            "id": 84800,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Spasi di sebelah kiri disebut <strong>indentasi</strong>. Saat kita menambahkan blok kode ke dalam blok kode lain, seluruh blok kode tersebut diberi indentasi sebanyak satu spasi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayAlarm\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"time\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (time === \" /><text value=\"&quot;7:00&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Waky waky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayAlarm(\" /><text value=\"&quot;7:00&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Waky waky\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>if (time === \"7:00\") {</code>, diikuti oleh <code>console.log(\"Waky waky\");</code>, dan terakhir <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Spasi di kiri disebut <strong>indentasi</strong>. Blok bersarang diberi satu spasi. Lengkapi agar waktu yang cocok menampilkan <code>Waky waky</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayAlarm\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"time\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (time === \" /><text value=\"&quot;7:00&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Waky waky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayAlarm(\" /><text value=\"&quot;7:00&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;8:00&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log(time);\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Waky waky\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>time</code>, diikuti oleh <code>===</code>, <code>console.log(\"Waky waky\");</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"7:00\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Code blocks",
            "id": 84796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Membungkus pernyataan <code>if</code> di dalam fungsi membantu kita mengatur dan menggunakan kembali kode. Sekarang, kita dapat menggunakan pernyataan <code>if</code> yang sama dengan pemanggilan fungsi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>isRentingAge</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>26</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Membungkus <code>if</code> dalam fungsi membantu mengatur dan memakai ulang kode. Panggil fungsi dengan usia yang membuatnya menampilkan <code>Approved</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"isRenting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"20\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>age</code>, diikuti oleh <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>21</code>, <code>isRentingAge</code>, dan terakhir <code>26</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiple instructions",
            "id": 85787,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Instruksi di luar blok kode bersarang tetap dijalankan, meskipun kode di dalam pernyataan kondisional dilewati.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Check Complete&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Check Complete\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: One indent",
            "id": 85825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang terjadi saat kita menambahkan pernyataan <code>if</code> di dalam fungsi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kita menambahkan blok kode di dalam blok kode lainnya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fungsi akan melewati blok <code>if</code> saat dipanggil</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kita menambahkan blok kode di dalam blok kode lainnya.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi sudah memiliki blok kode. Struktur apa yang dibuat dengan menaruh pernyataan <code>if</code> di dalamnya?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Blok kode di dalam blok kode lain</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fungsi kedua yang berjalan terpisah</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kondisi yang selalu dilewati fungsi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Blok kode di dalam blok kode lain.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Braces and spaces",
            "id": 85824,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa banyak instruksi di luar pernyataan <code>if</code> yang dimiliki fungsi ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Check done&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Check done\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Satu pernyataan tampilan</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada, semua instruksi merupakan bagian dari pernyataan <code>if</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Satu pernyataan tampilan.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat fungsi dipanggil dengan <code>15</code>, baris mana yang ditampilkan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Check done&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Check done\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hanya <code>Check done</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya <code>Approved</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Approved</code>, lalu <code>Check done</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Hanya <code>Check done</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Indenting the entire block",
            "id": 85826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa nama spasi di sebelah kiri instruksi bertingkat?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Indentasi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Blok kode</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Indentasi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Instruksi bergeser satu spasi ke kanan karena berada dalam blok kode lain. Apa sebutan spasi tambahan itu?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Indentasi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Pemanggilan fungsi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kondisi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Indentasi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Code blocks",
            "id": 85827,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa membungkus conditional di dalam fungsi itu berguna?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ini membantu kita mengatur dan menggunakan kembali kode</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bukan, ini sama seperti menulis ulang pernyataan <code>if</code> setiap kali kita membutuhkannya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ini membantu kita mengatur dan menggunakan kembali kode.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu membutuhkan pemeriksaan usia yang sama di beberapa tempat. Mengapa menaruh <code>if</code> itu dalam fungsi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kamu dapat mengatur pemeriksaan dan memakainya ulang dengan pemanggilan fungsi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kondisi akan berjalan tanpa memanggil fungsi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kamu harus menulis ulang kondisi untuk setiap penggunaan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kamu dapat mengatur pemeriksaan dan memakainya ulang dengan pemanggilan fungsi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple instructions",
            "id": 85828,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pernyataan display mana yang dijalankan saat memanggil <code>isLying(false)</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isLying\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome to the Lie Detector 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (boolean === \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;He's lying&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isLying(\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Welcome to the Lie Detector 3000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"He's lying\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kedua pernyataan display dijalankan</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya pernyataan display kedua yang dijalankan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kedua pernyataan display dijalankan.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pemanggilan meneruskan <code>false</code>. Dalam urutan apa program menampilkan pesannya?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isLying\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome to the Lie Detector 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (boolean === \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;He's lying&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isLying(\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Welcome to the Lie Detector 3000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"He's lying\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Welcome to the Lie Detector 3000</code>, lalu <code>He's lying</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya <code>He's lying</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>He's lying</code>, lalu <code>Welcome to the Lie Detector 3000</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Welcome to the Lie Detector 3000</code>, lalu <code>He's lying</code>.</p></body></html>"
